# The ledger of the control: two reason rows that hold one count row.  Each
# reason row holds a count row, so the ledger is correct.
format 1
rule erased-brand
reason include/ | a planted step of the plan for the headers
reason include/fixy/Planted.h | a planted step of the plan for this file
include/fixy/Planted.h | erased-brand | 1 | Permission | -
